{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensitive data filtering for ai workflows sensitive data filtering for ai workflows","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","fileName":"Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[DevOps AI Governance]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps AI Governance","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensitive data filtering for ai workflows sensitive data filtering for ai workflows","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","fileName":"Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows","heading":"Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Sensitive data filtering keeps secrets, credentials, connection strings, personally identifiable information, and unnecessary raw telemetry out of model context and durable artifacts. Logs should be sanitized before analysis, and environment secrets should be injected only into the job that needs them.\n\nFiltering must cover prompts, request bodies, workflow logs, artifacts, summaries, and memory writes. Masking an API key in console output is useful but insufficient if the same value can enter a raw response or stored context. Data minimization reduces both exposure and the amount of material a model must interpret.","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps AI Governance","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"sensitive data filtering for ai workflows sensitive data filtering for ai workflows","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","fileName":"Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Sensitive Data Filtering for AI Workflows","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps AI Governance","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}